1
00:00:00,205 --> 00:00:01,360
Five seconds.

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,358
Don't you DARE

3
00:00:02,358 --> 00:00:03,930
think of a white bear.

4
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:04,760
Go!

5
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:05,700
Too late.

6
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:07,725
Your brain hired a guard...

7
00:00:07,725 --> 00:00:09,332
to watch for bears.

8
00:00:09,332 --> 00:00:10,460
Keep trying.

9
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,383
Every few seconds, he checks...

10
00:00:12,383 --> 00:00:13,733
any bears?

11
00:00:13,778 --> 00:00:15,440
But to spot one...

12
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:18,133
he has to PICTURE one.

13
00:00:18,189 --> 00:00:19,370
In one study,

14
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:20,329
people rang a bell

15
00:00:20,329 --> 00:00:21,830
whenever it came back...

16
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:24,133
over once a minute!

17
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:24,936
It's probably why

18
00:00:24,936 --> 00:00:26,128
your cringiest moment

19
00:00:26,128 --> 00:00:28,080
replays at two a.m.

20
00:00:28,144 --> 00:00:29,179
The trick?

21
00:00:29,370 --> 00:00:30,529
Picture a red car

22
00:00:30,529 --> 00:00:31,840
instead.

23
00:00:31,910 --> 00:00:32,800
Ready?

